                 "    The pattern this temperament promotes carries no `@why` at all — its only\n    structural directive is `@see-also`\n    (`snatch/exchange-when-both-sides-gain.flexiarg:6`) — so its upward closure\n    is itself. When the promotion makes it the only pattern that fires, the\n    cascade the run stands on has one node and no edges. The score moves with\n    it: +3 to −5 against a snatcher under G4."}}},
