                 "    A policy left in the runner is invisible to the library the run claims to be\n    playing from: it cannot be read before the run, cited, refused, or set\n    beside another one. `p4ng/app-snatch.tex:231` records the order under\n    *Limits* as \"authored by hand\", and the harness's own re-wiring shows the\n    choice is not cosmetic — the same eighteen patterns score +3 or −5 against a\n    snatcher under G4 depending on nothing but it."}}},
